# EU Service Business Checklist System - PDF Structure

## Module 1: Pre-Project Setup
- [ ] Client requirements gathering completed
- [ ] Scope definition and approval signed
- [ ] Pricing and payment terms agreed
- [ ] Contract with GDPR compliance attached
- [ ] Project timeline approved by client
- [ ] Resource allocation confirmed
- [ ] Initial deposit received (per EU norms)

## Module 2: Project Kickoff
- [ ] Introduction call scheduled
- [ ] Stakeholder map created
- [ ] Communication channels established
- [ ] Working files shared with client
- [ ] First milestone deliverable defined
- [ ] Review meeting agenda sent

## Module 3: Execution Phase
- [ ] Daily progress tracking enabled
- [ ] Quality gates checked per deliverable
- [ ] Stakeholder feedback collected
- [ ] Change request log updated
- [ ] Risk register reviewed weekly
- [ ] Budget vs actual variance <5%

## Module 4: Review & Approval
- [ ] Deliverable meets quality standards
- [ ] Client sign-off obtained
- [ ] Invoice generated and sent
- [ ] Milestone completed in system
- [ ] Lessons learned documented

## Module 5: Delivery & Closeout
- [ ] Final deliverables transferred
- [ ] Training documentation provided
- [ ] Knowledge transfer completed
- [ ] Project retrospective held
- [ ] Case study approved (if applicable)
- [ ] Relationship handoff to account manager

## Module 6: Post-Project
- [ ] Follow-up survey sent
- [ ] Testimonial request issued
- [ ] Referral opportunity identified
- [ ] Contract renewal discussion (if annual)
- [ ] Archive files organized

---

*Appendices include templates for contracts, proposals, meeting minutes, and client communication scripts.*